COMPONENT TRACE: H1 (the canonical foreign-location hoax)
======================================================================
  source_base_trust=0.60, all metadata=True, cluster=1, no evidence, no obs
  quality = 0.30*1+0.25*1+0.20*1+0.15*1+0.10*1 = 1.00
  b_incident = 0.60 * (0.70 + 0.30*1.00) = 0.60 * 1.00 = 0.6000
  s_crowd=0, s_evidence=0, s_obs=0 -> s_support=0, delta_support=0
  c_positive = b_incident = 0.6000
  p_negative = 0 (no contradictions)
  applicable_cap = cap_citizen = 0.65 (no corroboration)
  final = min(c_positive=0.6000, cap=0.65) = 0.6000

  RESULT: Signal is absent because no component penalizes location mismatch.
  The score 0.6000 is purely from source_prior x quality_score x base_factor.

NOTE: K1 previously showed 0.5427 because that dataset had trust=0.60 and
  quality NOT 1.00 (some fields missing). The 5/5 posts here have ALL metadata
  complete so b_incident = 0.60*(0.70+0.30*1.00) = 0.60 exactly.
  The K1 0.5427 result was for posts with quality_score < 1.00.
  Either way, 0.6000 > 0.45 review line, confirming the problem.

